                <pb facs="0079" n="45" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v13/pg45"/>

                <head>Attachment</head>
                <p rendition="#center">PROPOSED PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT</p>
                <p>The Department of State feels that it should call the following to the attention
                    of any American citizens who have planned to be in the Jerusalem area within the
                    next few days.</p>
                <pb facs="0080" n="46" xml:id="pg46"/>
                <p>There are reports of tension in the area arising from plans of Israel authorities
                    to hold a large-scale military parade in the City of Jerusalem on April 24.
                    These reports indicate an increase in the amount of military equipment located
                    on both sides of the armistice demarcation line. Until this tension subsides,
                    the Department does not recommend travel to the area of Jerusalem if it can be
                    avoided.</p>
            </div>
